New PVSystem.PV_106 phases=1 bus1=trafo_pv_106 kV=0.24 kVA=100 irrad=0.98 Pmpp=75 temperature=25 PF=1 effcurve=Myeff P-TCurve=MyPvsT Daily=MyIrrad TDaily=MyTemp

